      "definition": "As used in sections 3707.511 and 3707.52 of the Revised Code, \"youth sports organization\" means a public or nonpublic entity that organizes an athletic activity in which the athletes are not more than nineteen years of age and are required to pay a fee to participate in the athletic activity or whose cost to participate is sponsored by a business or nonprofit organization.",
